    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d688">

                <pb facs="0902" n="888" sameAs="frus:frus1947v06/pg888"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Korea/12–3147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Embassy in El
                        Salvador </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-12-31T13:00:00-05:00">December 31,
                            1947—1 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>162. Seek early interview with FonMin to express high importance attached by US
                    Govt to Salvadoran participation in work of United Nations Temporary Commission
                    on Korea. Failure of El Salvador to participate in work of Commission would be
                    severe blow to functioning United Nations and would be subject to
                    misinterpretation and misleading propaganda by elements not interested in early
                    peaceful settlement Korean situation.</p>
                <p>For your information Salvadoran Amb<anchor n="8" xml:id="d688-f1"/> in Washington
                    is communicating with his Govt along same lines.</p>
                <p>Telegraph urgently decision Salvadoran Govt re participation Korean
                    Commission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d688-f1" n="8" xml:id="d688-f1-content">
                <p>Dr. Héctor David Castro.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
